---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base
  description="A free reference for BMW M3 owners and shoppers: factory spec, aftermarket parts with dated prices, build costs and maintenance."
>
  <div class="wrap py-8">
    <h1 class="text-(length:--fs-display)">M3 tool</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Work in progress: a free reference for BMW M3 owners and shoppers, covering factory spec, real
      aftermarket parts with dated prices, build costs and maintenance. Nothing is for sale and
      there are no store links.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
